{extends file="page.tmpl"}
{block name="title"}backuptools{/block}
{block name="head" append}
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{$smarty.const.SKINURL}css/pageheader.css" media="screen" />
{/block}
{block name="content"}

<div class="blurb vstretch">
<div class="header"><h1>backuptools</h1></div>
<div class="body">
<p>Backup utilities built on bbsengine6. rsync-based project and PostgreSQL database backups with staging and external device support.</p>
{if $currentmember.flags.AUTHENTICATED}
<p><a href="https://github.com/jonez734/backuptools">View source on GitHub</a></p>
{/if}
</div>
</div>

<div class="blurb vstretch">
<div class="header"><h1>quick start</h1></div>
<div class="body">
<p>Install with <code>pip install -e backuptools/src/</code>, then back up a project:</p>
<p><code>backup empyre</code></p>
<p>Back up multiple projects at once:</p>
<p><code>backup empyre teos asimov</code></p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="blurb vstretch">
<div class="header"><h1>backup modes</h1></div>
<div class="body">
<ul class="nobullets">
{foreach $data.modes as $mode}
<li>
<strong>{$mode.name}</strong>
<p><code>{$mode.command}</code></p>
<p>{$mode.description}</p>
</li>
{/foreach}
</ul>
</div>
</div>

<div class="blurb vstretch">
<div class="header"><h1>options</h1></div>
<div class="body">
<ul class="nobullets">
{foreach $data.options as $option}
<li><code>{$option.flag}</code> &mdash; {$option.description}</li>
{/foreach}
</ul>
</div>
</div>

<div class="blurb vstretch">
<div class="header"><h1>systemd integration</h1></div>
<div class="body">
<ul class="nobullets">
{foreach $data.systemd as $unit}
<li>
<strong>{$unit.name}</strong>
<p>{$unit.description}</p>
</li>
{/foreach}
</ul>
<p>Deploy with <code>sudo make prod</code> and enable with <code>sudo make prod-enable</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>

{/block}
